[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

; One variable: a type-less override of a node inside an instanced skinned `.glb`, written with the
; path Godot's importer gives it. The importer builds a Skeleton3D below `Armature`, and a
; BoneAttachment3D named `Hip` in it that holds `Sword`, which the file holds under the bone. The
; override moves `Sword` 1.5 units above the bone. A path that names no node moves nothing, so the
; box stays beside `Body`, where the file puts it. The two posts hold the framed bounds still.

